{"v":1,"book":"Deut","ch":10,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"At that time Jehovah said to me, Cut for yourself two tablets of stone like the first ones, and come up to Me on the mountain; and make yourself an ark of wood.","tok":[{"t":"At that "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to me, Cut for yourself "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tablets","s":["H3871"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"stone","s":["H0068"],"a":[9]},{"t":" like the "},{"t":"first","s":["H7223"],"a":[10]},{"t":" ones, and come "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[11]},{"t":" to Me on the mountain; and "},{"t":"make","s":["H6213"],"a":[14]},{"t":" yourself an "},{"t":"ark","s":["H0727"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"wood","s":["H6086"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And I will write upon the tablets the words which were on the first tablets, which you shattered; and you shall place them in the Ark.","tok":[{"t":"And I will "},{"t":"write","s":["H3789"],"a":[0]},{"t":" upon the "},{"t":"tablets","s":["H3871"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[4]},{"t":" which were on the "},{"t":"first","s":["H7223"],"a":[9]},{"t":" tablets, which you shattered; and you shall place them in the "},{"t":"Ark","s":["H0727"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"So I made an ark of acacia wood and cut two tablets of stone like the first ones; and I went up to the mountain with the two tablets in my hand.","tok":[{"t":"So I "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[0]},{"t":" an "},{"t":"ark","s":["H0727"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"acacia","s":["H7848"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wood","s":["H6086"],"a":[2]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"cut","s":["H6458"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tablets","s":["H3871"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"stone","s":["H0068"],"a":[7]},{"t":" like the "},{"t":"first","s":["H7223"],"a":[8]},{"t":" ones; and I went "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"mountain","s":["H2022"],"a":[10]},{"t":" with the "},{"t":"two","s":["H8147"],"a":[11]},{"t":" tablets in my "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And He wrote upon the tablets as He had done the first writing, the Ten Commandments, which Jehovah spoke to you on the mountain from the midst of the fire on the day of the assembly; and Jehovah gave them to me.","tok":[{"t":"And He "},{"t":"wrote","s":["H3789"],"a":[0]},{"t":" upon the tablets as He had done the "},{"t":"first","s":["H7223"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"writing","s":["H4385"],"a":[3]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"Ten","s":["H6235"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Commandments","s":["H1697"],"a":[7]},{"t":", which "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoke","s":["H1696"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to you on the mountain from the "},{"t":"midst","s":["H8432"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[14]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"assembly","s":["H6951"],"a":[16]},{"t":"; and "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"gave","s":["H5414"],"a":[17]},{"t":" them to me."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Then I turned and came down from the mountain, and I placed the tablets in the Ark that I had made. And there they have been, as Jehovah commanded me.","tok":[{"t":"Then I "},{"t":"turned","s":["H6437"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and came "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from the mountain, and I placed the tablets in the "},{"t":"Ark","s":["H0727"],"a":[7]},{"t":" that I had "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[9]},{"t":". And there they have been, as "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"commanded","s":["H6680"],"a":[13]},{"t":" me."}]},{"n":6,"text":"(And the children of Israel set out from Beeroth Bene-jaakan for Moserah. There Aaron died, and there he was buried; and Eleazar his son served as priest in his place.","tok":[{"t":"(And the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[0]},